From 28e07800a41d9045e7938a627adaabd963b90bd3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 18 Jul 2026 11:07:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] net: omci: load normalized identity from firmware

Load GPON and OMCI identity values from direct firmware properties or
NVMEM cells, including U-Boot environment variables exposed by the NVMEM
layout. Normalize raw, vendor-prefixed and hexadecimal serial formats.

Track the source of each value and expose it with configuration replies.
Use the same normalized identity for GPON activation and the OMCI MIB.

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
---
 MAINTAINERS                                   |   1 +
 .../net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_gpon_omci.c    |   5 +-
 .../net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_gpon_omci.h    |   4 +-
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_xpon.c     |  78 ++--
 include/net/omci.h                            |  38 ++
 include/uapi/linux/omci.h                     |  15 +-
 net/omci/Makefile                             |   2 +-
 net/omci/agent.c                              | 113 ++++-
 net/omci/core.c                               |  72 ++-
 net/omci/identity.c                           | 431 ++++++++++++++++++
 net/omci/internal.h                           |  10 +
 11 files changed, 696 insertions(+), 73 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 net/omci/identity.c

